                    <p>This article was written and reviewed by the iMedic Medical Editorial Team, comprising licensed physicians specializing in emergency medicine, trauma care, and critical care. Our team follows strict editorial guidelines based on the GRADE evidence framework, ensuring all content is accurate, up-to-date, and clinically relevant.</p>

                    <div class="editorial-team-grid">
